'' AN 'inline' FUNCTION OF A SYSTEM HEADER IS NOT DECLARED (tiko-vendor RFC-0001 D4): the UCRT
'' exports none of windows.h's and stdio.h's, PtrToUlong is header-only by design, and libclang
'' says the SDK is a system header. So it stays TKO0743, and the ledger names it (D5).
'' TEST: cli
'' HOSTS: windows
''     (the Windows SDK's headers (windows.h, the UCRT's stdio.h): only a Windows host has them)
'' CLEAN: build/.cins
'' STEP: -target windows-x86_64 -cimport tests/cimport/src/inline/sys.h -cimport-out build/.cins/sys.bi
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -cnocache --dump-ir tests/cimport/src/inline/sysuse.tiko
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: error TKO0743: 'ptrtoulong' is not declared
'' EXPECT-FILE-HAS: build/.cins/sys.bi :: function  PtrToUlong                  inline, no symbol
'' EXPECT-FILE-HAS: build/.cins/sys.bi :: function  _snprintf_l                 inline, no symbol
'' EXPECT-FILE-NOT-HAS: build/.cins/sys.bi :: declare function PtrToUlong
'' EXPECT-FILE-NOT-HAS: build/.cins/sys.bi :: declare function _snprintf_l
